<description>&lt;p&gt;Thai forces are firing warning shots and have closed unofficial border trade for seven days as Myanmar drone strikes and artillery reach villages in Tak and Mae Sot. Police rescued three Chinese nationals in Tak province before they could be trafficked to a Myanmar call centre, while locals in Tak seek protection as the Karen State conflict intensifies. Authorities arrested two Singaporeans and three Thais for a cross-border prostitution network, seized 2.74 million meth pills hidden in furniture, and detained six Cambodians for illegal crossing. The conflict caused 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYEFVX3lxTE9wVGNpQlpOXzZaanExX3pVdUQtNDRlRTdlYWFwZ2VLV0g1V3R4dUI2dGNFWGZva0dDUzRWYXRZWm1JX0ZqalFJQ093Zk1FdkFhRjFtSVE0Y1JiajRnUDcyOA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Thai PBS World&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYEFVX3lxTE5KejV0aldhdlc1c1hUMk9HY2dESWlVQXpibGMyclo5cUpvZGtuOC1EUjVRTVBNWC1fcGRyYnhKSXNCbW14TEk4dkpUMEhvZFpPbmp6SWFqMGxtdUhYWGdnUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Thai PBS World&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxQYVB3c1FVeTMtcnJpV0gxbXBEMHU4b2t4ZDBZNXJqcjlndHAxR0ZxajdfVk5DSlVtcXltd25OSlN5VUZ1eGlwR0lkQU0wMmlpMGMyS1JPbWpiXzlFay1sTU1Nb2pyUE5JT0VDb2V2Y29WQ3VHRHBZUFNITGZOc085NmxzLTE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Thaiger&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxNX09RRUgzZkw1UThKeklvQW83bjcwbTZ1N29FSlpEUU5POHNEUU1INzc5ck41Vi1HdHpvU0JaTVp6bzZrWnhFZVpwV2Vrak1zSFFSVExNSU5HNEtBeW1weXk2ZlBGLWZKSThCS0pVR0drTDE3NGdpdUMza0hrWnBBRVJCTkl2eHdVRnl2WklNNXV5d00?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bangkok Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxQZVliMWhfUjVkT3hjSTdLNzlXVUVndlBoWmlSU0loRHNwTVNQVXdCbzlwNmV1WDRHRmlaSk5tcWdQcU9ORlZxM1FXVUxVR1ktZFpXLVYtSzRMbnN6bFg4